      "id": "K3.1",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume `python sales_summary.py FILE [FILE ...]` accepts one or more CSV paths and aggregates them. Assume headers `region,product,units,unit_price`; calculate revenue as units times unit_price and print labeled total revenue, revenue by region, and units by product to stdout. Exact formatting and schema remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "id": "K3.2",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume exit code 0 on success and a nonzero exit with a useful stderr message for unreadable files or invalid CSV records; exact codes and messages are unspecified."
    },
