      "id": "K4.1",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume rows and supplied files are aggregated, monetary calculations use decimal arithmetic, and processing ends after the summary is printed or an error occurs. Currency, rounding, and other sales rules are unspecified."
    },
    {
      "id": "K4.2",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume missing required headers or values, nonnumeric units or unit prices, and unreadable files are invalid. Treatment of negative values and fractional units requires a recorded default or evidence."
    },
    {
      "id": "K5.1",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume the invoking process owns in-memory aggregates for one invocation; input files remain unchanged and no state persists after exit."
    },
    {
      "id": "K5.2",
      "basis": "default",
      "answer": "Assume input access and output visibility follow the invoking user's operating-system permissions; no shared application state or restart recovery is required. Concurrent file changes have no specified consistency guarantee."
    },
